{"title":"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real numbers</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e177c64a9bd9fbd2c9981d13826cbac308ae28ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a * b=(a-b)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"19\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d44f897632f63376db40477827d960c937afc573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2*(y-x)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faec476c7b5eecf93252e43ac317c97e29cad02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ x^2+y^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 2x^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 2y^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 4xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"445\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb291e6d85c652622a4d9fae84cb018590486091.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-a)^2 = a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"19\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/778ce670e5329492e792cbb91fdbb454f480e71f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2 = (y-x)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"19\" />, and \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/138e0ad8d731afe82997734cb68305608ba9622d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-y)^2 * (y-x)^2 = [(x-y)^2 - (y-x)^2]^2 = [(x-y)^2 - (x-y)^2]^2 = 0\\ \\mathrm{(A)}.\\]\" width=\"522\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B\">2008 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php